# COPY held with white key 1 copies track 1's slot 1, then key 8 pastes it
# into slot 8 (`clipcopy 0 0`, `clippaste 0 7`). CLEAR held with key 8 asks
# to confirm, and CLEAR again deletes it (`clipdelat 0 7`). CLEAR + key 2
# asks again, and key 5 only closes the question. Then PLAY/STOP.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:SEQ
--key 0.20:8:100:0.4
--key 0.30:0:100:0.05
--key 0.40:12:100:0.05
--key 0.80:10:100:0.3
--key 0.90:12:100:0.05
--key 1.30:10:100:0.05
--key 1.60:10:100:0.3
--key 1.70:2:100:0.05
--key 2.10:7:100:0.05
--button 2.50:PLAY/STOP
